# The root .gitignore excludes *.tgz to keep stray npm packs out of the repo.
# The golden bundle's tarballs are not packs: they are fixed-byte stand-ins
# whose hashes its inventory commits to. Without them the bundle fails its own
# rule 5 (closed inventory) and `kb release verify-bundle` cannot be run
# against it. The rule lives here, not inside the bundle, because a bundle
# directory holding an extra file would itself be a rule 5 violation.
!golden/npm/*.tgz
